          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Flipkart Pauses IPO Plans Indefinitely Amid Rising Market Volatility and Crowded Public Issue Pipeline",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "Walmart-owned Flipkart has indefinitely paused its long-anticipated IPO discussions as rising market volatility and a congested public issue pipeline make the timing unfavourable. The company is instead redirecting investment into its quick commerce arm, Flipkart Minutes, as e-commerce growth shows signs of plateauing. The pause follows similar postponements by other major Indian tech firms and signals caution in the broader Indian startup IPO market.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/flipkart-pauses-ipo-discussions-amid-rising-volatility-in-markets/articleshow/131110424.cms",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
